@startuml email_activity_no_storage
title Email Generator Tool - Activity Diagram (No Storage Lifelines)
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Receive root URL, provider rows,\nand extraction results;
:Deserialize typed inputs;
:Collect StreamEvidence\nfrom streams, servers, screenshots;
if (provider analysis is empty?) then (yes)
  :Use available stream evidence\nbut no resolved abuse contact;
else (no)
  :Map provider rows to stream URLs;
endif
:Normalize channel names;
:Group rows by channel,\nprovider name, and contact key;
while (group remains?) is (yes)
  :Select stream URLs and screenshots;
  :Build DMCA subject;
  :Build evidence-rich draft body;
  :Attach provider and stream evidence;
  :Create TakedownEmail object;
endwhile (done)
:Return review-only email drafts\nwithout sending anything;
stop
@enduml
